WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.423 --> 00:00:03.216
- And all I do is hold
my breath and then cry

00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:04.966
after she's finished.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.705
Oh my gosh, yes.

00:00:07.705 --> 00:00:10.538
(soft rock music)

00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:15.974
And yes, you hear people
saying just how great

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:18.815
your daughter is but
Simone is still Simone

00:00:18.815 --> 00:00:21.405
and my daughter so I
don't see her or put her

00:00:21.405 --> 00:00:22.451
on a pedestal.

00:00:22.451 --> 00:00:24.784
(soft rock)

00:00:25.728 --> 00:00:27.741
- Just to do the dishes.

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:30.391
- So if it's here turn, yes,
she needs to get out of bed

00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:32.151
and get over there and do the dishes.

00:00:32.151 --> 00:00:34.341
(soft rock)

00:00:34.341 --> 00:00:36.102
- One time we were going out to dinner

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:39.041
and we walk out of our
rooms, wearing the exact

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:40.755
same outfits.

00:00:40.755 --> 00:00:42.841
So it was like, who wore it better.

00:00:42.841 --> 00:00:44.265
- Who wore it best.

00:00:44.265 --> 00:00:45.736
I did.
- [Simone] Me, obviously me.

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:49.473
I'm like, someone has to go
change and it's not gonna be me.

00:00:49.473 --> 00:00:51.250
So we just went to dinner
wearing the same thing.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.373
(soft rock)

00:00:54.373 --> 00:00:58.023
- And it was not until 2013 where she won

00:00:58.023 --> 00:00:59.686
the world competition.

00:00:59.686 --> 00:01:04.125
It was a very special moment,
I remember crying and crying.

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:07.628
- Yes, it made me tear up
'cause I got a big screen

00:01:07.628 --> 00:01:10.145
in the arena, they'd showed
my parents and I've never

00:01:10.145 --> 00:01:13.069
really seen my mom cry or my dad cry.

00:01:13.069 --> 00:01:15.177
And they were sobbing up
there, I was like, Oh my God,

00:01:15.177 --> 00:01:17.098
they're just so cute.

00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:19.491
It just made feel so
accomplished that they're

00:01:19.491 --> 00:01:21.377
just so proud of me that they cried.

00:01:21.377 --> 00:01:24.541
(soft rock music)

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:26.494
It means the worlds just 'cause she's gone

00:01:26.494 --> 00:01:29.262
in and out of loops for
me and she'll do anything.

00:01:29.262 --> 00:01:31.390
She's given up so much
and sacrificed so much

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.812
for me to achieve the
things that I've achieved.

00:01:33.812 --> 00:01:37.562
It's just amazing what she
does and what moms would do.

00:01:37.562 --> 00:01:40.645
I am absolutely proud of my daughter.

